        <activityName xml:lang="en">Recycling aggregate from mixed demolition, dry, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Recycling aggregate from mixed demolition, dry, at plant
This is a multi output process of mixed demolition entering the recycling plant. An economic allocation is applied between the disposal service of mixed demolition and the recycling product RC-M;
UUID: 730bdb86-26fa-3ada-bd05-ff4bc719b7b6
Includes the infrastructure, energy demand and waste of the recycling process of mixed demolition
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: dry processing, stationary crusher
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_730bdb86-26fa-3ada-bd05-ff4bc719b7b6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
